     1→/**
     2→ * E2E API Tests for Daemon Agent Dispatch Integration
     3→ *
     4→ * Tests verify actual HTTP behavior for agent dispatch routes by calling
     5→ * the running daemon directly.
     6→ *
     7→ * Covered ACs:
     8→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-1: File watcher detects task state changes and emits events
     9→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-2: POST /api/agent/events accepts task state change events
    10→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-3: Dispatch engine processes events and broadcasts on agents WS topic
    11→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-4: WebSocket broadcast with session_id, agent_id, task_id, status, timestamp
    12→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-5: GET /api/agent/status returns dispatch_enabled, active_invocations, queue_depth, agent_definitions
    13→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-6: POST /api/agent/dispatch with action start|stop returns dispatch_enabled
    14→ * - @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-7: Event emission fails silently when engine not running
    15→ */
    16→
    17→// Trait N/A annotations
    18→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-1 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    19→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-2 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    20→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-3 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    21→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-4 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    22→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-5 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    23→// AC: @trait-json-output ac-6 — N/A: agent dispatch is an HTTP/WebSocket API, not a CLI command
    24→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-1 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    25→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-2 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    26→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-3 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    27→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-4 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    28→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-5 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    29→// AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-6 — N/A: error guidance is a CLI pattern; daemon uses HTTP error codes
    30→// AC: @trait-localhost-security ac-1 — N/A: localhost security tested in api-server.spec.ts
    31→// AC: @trait-localhost-security ac-2 — N/A: non-localhost rejection tested in api-server.spec.ts
    32→// AC: @trait-localhost-security ac-3 — N/A: daemon does not support external binding configuration
    33→// AC: @trait-websocket-protocol ac-1 — N/A: WebSocket connect lifecycle tested in api-websocket.spec.ts
