    41→// AC: @trait-api-endpoint ac-4 — N/A: agent dispatch endpoints do not support pagination
    42→// AC: @trait-api-endpoint ac-5 — N/A: agent dispatch endpoints operate on daemon state, not shadow branch
    43→// AC: @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-1 — N/A: file watcher integration is tested implicitly via the dispatch engine; isolated watcher+diffing behavior is covered in unit tests (agent-dispatch-engine.test.ts ac-5)
    44→// AC: @daemon-agent-dispatch ac-3, ac-4 — N/A: actual invocation broadcasts require a real agent adapter (claude-agent-acp) which cannot run in E2E; the event callback wiring is verified by unit inspection of createEngine() in agent-dispatch.ts
